MEMORANDUM
TO:

Mayor Patrick Collins, and City Council
FROM:

TJ Barttelbort, Purchasing Manager
DATE:

April 19, 2023
SUBJECT:
Consideration of Bid #S-19-23 for an Agreement between the City of Cheyenne
and T C Solutions for the Cheyenne Junior League Storage Facility Construction
project
 ______________________________________________
Bid #S-19-23 was solicited for the Cheyenne Junior League Storage Facility Construction project.
Project vicinity map included.

Six (6) bidders responded to this bid, and the bid tabulation is attached.  The Bids were received
from:
1. TC Solutions.  Cheyenne, Wyoming.
2. GH Phipps.  Laramie, Wyoming.
3. Reiman Corp.  Cheyenne, Wyoming.
4. Synergy Construction.  Lovell, Wyoming.
5. S & S Builders.  Cheyenne, Wyoming.
6. Richardson Construction, Inc.  Cheyenne, Wyoming.

The bids were reviewed by Jason Sanchez (CRE), and Sam Payne (CRE) and their
recommendation is to accept the lowest responsive bid from T C Solutions, Cheyenne, WY.

The total Bid Award amount is $144,406.00

Funding:
013-21-2111-45-43903 (Development Impact Fees / Parks Improvements)
($21,936.00)
011-21-2111-42-86983 (Cheyenne Community Recreation District Grant)
($122,470.00)
Project #45400

Grand Total $144,406.00
```

